@startuml
title Import and validate price data (ASUC-03)
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow false
participant "Time Trigger" as P0 #edf1f5
participant "Price Importer" as P1 #fff3df
participant "Policy Engine" as P2 #e3f6ed
participant "Price Data Provider" as P3 #edf1f5
participant "Data Store" as P4 #f3edff
participant "Event Bus" as P5 #edf1f5
participant "Job Scheduler" as P6 #fff3df
P0 -> P1 : Start scheduled import(sourceId)
activate P1
P1 -> P2 : Read operating mode
P2 --> P1 : GREEN | AMBER | RED
P1 -> P1 : Select batches; the daily batch always runs, optional backfill only in GREEN
P1 -> P3 : Fetch approved observation batch
activate P3
P3 --> P1 : Records / source error
deactivate P3
alt batch received
P1 -> P4 : Store batch as received with checksum (raw layer)
loop each record
P1 -> P1 : Validate variant, retailer, currency, positive price, time
alt valid record
P1 -> P1 : Normalize decimal amount, UTC time, currency code
else invalid record
P1 -> P1 : Add to reject list with reason
end
end
P1 -> P4 : Upsert accepted records by stable source identity
activate P4
P4 --> P1 : Inserted / updated / unchanged counts
deactivate P4
P1 -> P4 : Write import report (accepted, rejected, reasons)
P1 -> P5 : Publish price.changed(changed laptops, run id)
P5 -> P6 : Deliver priceChanged
P6 -> P4 : Keep one open forecast job per laptop (deadline now + 24 h, never reset)
else source unavailable
P1 -> P4 : Record failed import run; retry at next trigger
end
P1 --> P0 : Import outcome
deactivate P1
@enduml
